A20. When things get this way you pay and pay and pay. ~ DUE
A21. A sexy pronoun. ~ IT
A22. Colorful bloomers (singular). ~ PANSY
A24. A little scientific work. ~ ERG
A26. A tongue sandwich—almost all gone. ~ TS
A27. Yes men. ~ AIDES
A29. What a well-trained butler answers to. ~ AD
A31. One of these comes with every purchase. ~ SALES
A33. You can take this in your ear. ~ TOUR
A34. Most subway passengers have a hand in this. ~ STRAP
A37. A subject you like to harp on. ~ LYRE
A38. You rarely turn over a new leaf after this. ~ END
A39. Anyone can go into this kind of dive. ~ PLUNGE
A40. How much rent you'd like to pay. ~ LESS
